{"unit":8,"items":21,"pass":15,"title":"Final Test · Unit 8","html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Final Test\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Unit 8 &middot; Final Test &middot; end of level</div>\n      <h2>Plans and experience</h2>\n      <p>Twenty-one questions on Lessons 29&ndash;32: going to, offers, Present Perfect, phone calls. Answer them all, then press Check. You need <b>15 out of 21</b> to pass &mdash; and you can take this test as many times as you like. This is the last test of the level.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"review-u8\">\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Part 1 &middot; Grammar and vocabulary &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 1&ndash;15</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Choose the correct answer.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">I'm ___ to start a blog next year.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">going</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">gone</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">go</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">She is going ___ learn to drive.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">for</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">at</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">to</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">___ you going to travel next year?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Do</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Have</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Are</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">He ___ going to smoke again. (negative)\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">isn't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">doesn't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">hasn't</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">Don't worry — ___ carry the bags. (offer)\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">I'll</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">I'm</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">I've</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">___ I open the window? (offer)\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Do</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Shall</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Am</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">7</span><span class=\"body\">I called you ___ ask about the party.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">to</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">for</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">because to</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">8</span><span class=\"body\">She ___ won many prizes.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">is</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">has</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">have</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">9</span><span class=\"body\">Have you ever ___ to a concert?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">been</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">go</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">went</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">10</span><span class=\"body\">I've never ___ sushi.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">ate</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">eaten</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">eat</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">11</span><span class=\"body\">I ___ the film last week. (finished time!)\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">have seen</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">see</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">saw</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">12</span><span class=\"body\">read → read → ___\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">red</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">read</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">readed</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">13</span><span class=\"body\">Could I ___ to the manager, please?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">speaking</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">to speak</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">speak</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">14</span><span class=\"body\">I'm afraid she's not ___ at the moment.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">here now yes</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">available</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">possible</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">15</span><span class=\"body\">Would you like to leave a ___?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">phone</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">talk</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">message</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 2 &middot; Write the answer &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 16&ndash;21</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Type your answer. Spelling counts; capital letters and full stops do not.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">16</span><span class=\"body\">Say the plan: I / learn to drive<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"I'm going to learn to drive.|I am going to learn to drive.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">17</span><span class=\"body\">Offer with Shall: make tea<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Shall I make tea?\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">18</span><span class=\"body\">Make a question: you / ever / eat sushi<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Have you ever eaten sushi?\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">19</span><span class=\"body\">Finished time → past: I see the film. (last week)<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"I saw the film last week.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">20</span><span class=\"body\">On the phone — ask for Ms Lee.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Could I speak to Ms Lee, please?|Could I speak to Ms Lee?|Can I speak to Ms Lee, please?\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">21</span><span class=\"body\">Fix the mistake: She have won many prizes.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"She has won many prizes.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"checkReview(this)\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Check my answers</button>\n      <div class=\"res\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"reviewResult\" class=\"review-result\"></div>\n  </section>\n"}